corelocation is a rewrite of the core query client from:
https://github.com/acheong08/apple-corelocation-experiments
Upstream revision: 0b136860e80585c02c12f64933995b872d7623af
Original project author: acheong08 and contributors.

The BSSIDApple and wifiTiles protobuf schemas and generated Go files under
internal/pb are retained verbatim from that revision. Protocol constants and
observations derive from the original project; query/client/routing/geometry/CLI
implementations are rewritten. The original project's GNU GPL version 3 license
is retained in LICENSE. This is not an Apple-supported SDK or Apple product.
